Section 1: Executive Summary

* What platform is being governed? - BOX AI
* What does it do? - Box AI functions as an intelligent content management enhancement that integrates advanced AI models directly into your secure cloud storage to streamline how you interact with business files. By leveraging this tool, you can perform Natural Language queries across individual or multiple documents to find specific details, such as contract clauses or financial figures, without manually scanning through large volumes of text.
* Why does the organization want to use it? - Organizations adopt Box AI to unlock intelligent workflows that transform how teams manage, analyze, and generate content at scale. By combining AI capabilities directly with secure content storage, Box AI enables departments across finance, legal, HR, and marketing to automate repetitive tasks, extract hidden insights from documents, and accelerate decision-making — all while maintaining enterprise-grade security and compliance standards.

